---
description: UI library conventions
globs: "ui/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Own UI library in `/ui/` — semantic, accessible, minimal
- Reusable components must not contain business logic
- Theme variables in `@ui/common/src/theme/specifications.ts`

### Web only
- Class names use kebab-case in CSS modules
- CSS modules (`*.module.css`) with `className` over inline `style`

### Mobile (React Native) only
- Use `StyleSheet.create` for styles
- No CSS modules, no CSS custom properties
